{"unit_id":"NokorinNishikino__Kidai-Clipboard#card-zh","repo":"NokorinNishikino/Kidai-Clipboard","commit":"08d55d5fe8fba66543137516d5f391ecfd5913ca","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"Kidai-ClipBoard（纪代剪贴板）是一个面向 DSH Web 和桌面客户端的会话剪贴板。它在侧栏提供打开入口，并在悬浮窗口中保存输入草稿和会话历史快照；保存会话时可选择已完成轮次作为分支点。快照可整理到文件夹、添加标签、搜索和置顶，也能从保存点 fork 到新会话，或复制转录并粘贴到输入框。适合需要跨会话复用提示草稿、归档对话并从历史上下文继续工作的 DSH 用户。状态保存在本机 DSH 数据目录，不需要额外 API Key 或账号。","source":"generated","evidence":["package.json:5-5","package.json:51-70","lib/client.js:946-1087","lib/client.js:1093-1175","lib/index.js:17-19"]}
{"unit_id":"NokorinNishikino__Kidai-Clipboard#card-en","repo":"NokorinNishikino/Kidai-Clipboard","commit":"08d55d5fe8fba66543137516d5f391ecfd5913ca","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Kidai-ClipBoard is a DSH clipboard for saving composer drafts and session snapshots. Its floating window lets users choose a completed turn, organize entries with folders and tags, search saved items, and fork a snapshot into a new session. It stores state locally and needs no API key or account.","source":"generated","evidence":["package.json:5-5","package.json:51-70","lib/client.js:946-1087","lib/client.js:1093-1175","lib/index.js:17-19"]}
