{"unit_id":"NokorinNishikino__Kidai-Clipboard#caveat-1","repo":"NokorinNishikino/Kidai-Clipboard","commit":"08d55d5fe8fba66543137516d5f391ecfd5913ca","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"Kidai-ClipBoard 使用前须知：草稿、保存的会话记录和转录会写入本机 DSH 数据目录，并在浏览器 localStorage 留有启动回退副本；清理插件数据时需考虑两处存储。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:17-19","lib/client.js:674-689","lib/client.js:715-740"]}
